{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062150/extras/css_wish.png?t=1744205417\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062150/extras/wishlist.gif?t=1744205417\" /><br>Car Service Simulator combines <strong>realistic car repair, customization, business management, and open-world exploration</strong>. Run your own auto service center, repair and modify cars, and grow your business while exploring a dynamic world. <strong>Master car maintenance, impress customers, and dominate the industry!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062150/extras/ezgif-2-b108329db7.gif?t=1744205417\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd27 Main Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Become a <strong>Master Car Repair and Maintenance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diagnose and fix <strong>engines, brakes, suspensions, and transmissions</strong> using advanced tools. Replace worn-out parts, rebuild engines, and handle complex repairs. Upgrade your skills to take on bigger challenges and become the go-to expert in the auto industry. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062150/extras/ezgif-4e02b6cfff115.gif?t=1744205417\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customize and Upgrade Cars for Maximum Performance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use a <strong>professional paint booth</strong> to create stunning designs. Modify vehicles with <strong>body kits, performance parts, and custom wraps</strong>. Improve speed, handling, and aesthetics to meet customer demands and build a reputation for top-quality work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062150/extras/gif-2.gif?t=1744205417\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Manage and Expand Your Auto Service Business</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Negotiate with customers, set competitive prices, and invest in better equipment. <strong>Buy, sell, and trade parts</strong> to maximize profits. A well-managed business means <strong>more customers, higher earnings, and a thriving workshop</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Professional Wash:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deep clean vehicles</strong> using your washing machine. Make vehicles shine like the first day by using cleaning materials and water effectively. Improve your washing skills and equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062150/extras/gif-1.gif?t=1744205417\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Strategic Business Management:  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use an effective negotiation system to increase customer satisfaction. Listen to customers' complaints, negotiate deals with them and maximize your profits. Make strategic decisions to grow your business and achieve success. <br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore an Open World Full of Opportunities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit the <strong>junkyard</strong> to find rare parts, explore the <strong>marketplace</strong> for deals, or order premium components online.<strong>\u00a0Grow your empire</strong> in a fully interactive open-world environment.<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your own car service empire, master car maintenance and maximize customer satisfaction with Car Service Simulator.<strong>.</strong>Customize, repair, wash, and manage your dream garage. Add to your wishlist now!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3062150?t=1744205417","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062150/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744205417","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062150/cbf032448fc219b22f654c74a009b2e13aa419b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744205417","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062150/cbf032448fc219b22f654c74a009b2e13aa419b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744205417","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3268930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062150/extras/RoadmapEN.jpg?t=1744205417\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062150/extras/css_wish.png?t=1744205417\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062150/extras/wishlist.gif?t=1744205417\" /><br>Car Service Simulator combines <strong>realistic car repair, customization, business management, and open-world exploration</strong>. Run your own auto service center, repair and modify cars, and grow your business while exploring a dynamic world. <strong>Master car maintenance, impress customers, and dominate the industry!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062150/extras/ezgif-2-b108329db7.gif?t=1744205417\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd27 Main Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Become a <strong>Master Car Repair and Maintenance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diagnose and fix <strong>engines, brakes, suspensions, and transmissions</strong> using advanced tools. Replace worn-out parts, rebuild engines, and handle complex repairs. Upgrade your skills to take on bigger challenges and become the go-to expert in the auto industry. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062150/extras/ezgif-4e02b6cfff115.gif?t=1744205417\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customize and Upgrade Cars for Maximum Performance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use a <strong>professional paint booth</strong> to create stunning designs. Modify vehicles with <strong>body kits, performance parts, and custom wraps</strong>. Improve speed, handling, and aesthetics to meet customer demands and build a reputation for top-quality work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062150/extras/gif-2.gif?t=1744205417\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Manage and Expand Your Auto Service Business</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Negotiate with customers, set competitive prices, and invest in better equipment. <strong>Buy, sell, and trade parts</strong> to maximize profits. A well-managed business means <strong>more customers, higher earnings, and a thriving workshop</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Professional Wash:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deep clean vehicles</strong> using your washing machine. Make vehicles shine like the first day by using cleaning materials and water effectively. Improve your washing skills and equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062150/extras/gif-1.gif?t=1744205417\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Strategic Business Management:  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use an effective negotiation system to increase customer satisfaction. Listen to customers' complaints, negotiate deals with them and maximize your profits. Make strategic decisions to grow your business and achieve success. <br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore an Open World Full of Opportunities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit the <strong>junkyard</strong> to find rare parts, explore the <strong>marketplace</strong> for deals, or order premium components online.<strong>\u00a0Grow your empire</strong> in a fully interactive open-world environment.<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your own car service empire, master car maintenance and maximize customer satisfaction with Car Service Simulator.<strong>.</strong>Customize, repair, wash, and manage your dream garage. Add to your wishlist now!</p>","developers":["Red Axe Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062150/header.jpg?t=1744205417","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257101804,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101804/movie480.mp4?t=1740411400","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101804/movie_max.mp4?t=1740411400"},"name":"Car Service Simulator - Demo Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257101804/53b74c5680c95481f2c125952c72d4fab8d119d5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740411400","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101804/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740411400","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101804/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740411400"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257083065,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257083065/movie480.mp4?t=1740411402","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/